---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service | EV Kelly Calculator"
  description="Review the terms of service and usage rules for the EV Kelly Calculator."
>
  <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto w-full min-h-screen px-4 py-12 md:py-20 flex flex-col">
    
    <header class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <h1 class="animate-reveal text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-[var(--theme-text-main)] mb-4" style="opacity: 0;">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="animate-reveal delay-100 text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] font-medium" style="opacity: 0;">
        Effective Date: July 4, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="liquid-panel static-panel w-full p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col gap-8">
      
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          By accessing and using the EV Kelly Calculator ("the Service"), you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement. If you do not agree to abide by these terms, please immediately cease use of this Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--theme-accent-red)] tracking-tight">2. Strict Educational Purposes</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          The mathematical projections, position sizing outputs, and data provided by the EV Kelly Calculator are for <strong>educational and informational purposes only</strong>. We are not registered financial advisors, brokers, or dealers. Nothing on this platform constitutes investment, financial, or trading advice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">3. Platform Usage & Restrictions</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          You are granted a limited, non-exclusive license to use the calculator for your personal edge tracking. The automated scraping, data mining, or programmatic extraction of the underlying mathematical logic or UI components from this platform is strictly prohibited. 
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          The Service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis. While we strive for mathematical accuracy, we make no guarantees regarding the reliability, accuracy, or completeness of the calculator's outputs. The tool operates under theoretical assumptions (such as zero slippage and static probability) which will never perfectly reflect real-world market variance.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          All content, visual interfaces, graphics, design, compilation, and code used to operate the Service are the property of EV Kelly Calculator and are protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not copy, reproduce, or distribute the underlying code or design structure without explicit written permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          We reserve the right, at our sole discretion, to modify or replace these Terms at any time. It is your responsibility to check this page periodically for changes. Your continued use of the Service following the posting of any changes constitutes acceptance of those changes.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>